msgid "\"Detail-oriented customer service specialist with 4+ years of experience in retail and call center environments. Skilled in communication, issue resolution, and handling high-volume customer requests. Seeking a full-time support role in a growth-focused company.\""
msgstr "\"Detail-oriented customer service specialist with 4+ years of experience in retail and call center environments. Skilled in communication, issue resolution, and handling high-volume customer requests. Seeking a full-time support role in a growth-focused company.\""

msgid "\"Handled 60+ customer requests per day and improved first-contact resolution rate by 18% over 6 months.\""
msgstr "\"Handled 60+ customer requests per day and improved first-contact resolution rate by 18% over 6 months.\""

msgid "\"Responsible for customer support and daily operations.\""
msgstr "\"Responsible for customer support and daily operations.\""

